[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7561.75, "timestamp": "02:06:01", "text": "我当时就站在乔克的店门口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7565.35, "timestamp": "02:06:05", "text": "房子。好的。我当时哭了起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7568.39, "timestamp": "02:06:08", "text": "更衣室，因为我真的在里面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7571.189, "timestamp": "02:06:11", "text": "他家门前，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7573.589, "timestamp": "02:06:13", "text": "但我们根本无法见面。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7577.35, "timestamp": "02:06:17", "text": "乔克好像发高烧了。啊，是的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7580.55, "timestamp": "02:06:20", "text": "那天是不是发烧了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7582.629, "timestamp": "02:06:22", "text": "当时正在下雨，我不想去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7586.87, "timestamp": "02:06:26", "text": "就因为这个，Jock 就跑过去了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7589.91, "timestamp": "02:06:29", "text": "其实我们已经见过面了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7594.229, "timestamp": "02:06:34", "text": "工作做得不好。我哥哥要来了。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7597.75, "timestamp": "02:06:37", "text": "更有可能再次获胜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7604.51, "timestamp": "02:06:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7615.75, "timestamp": "02:06:55", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7619.75, "timestamp": "02:06:59", "text": "里面？将内部两个角都加粗。"}]